cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this formalization, please cite it as below. Status: candidate proof,
  AI-generated and AI-reviewed; a Lean 4 proof of the formal-conjectures statement
  Erdos184.erdos_184 passes the project's acceptance checks [[PUBLIC-RELEASE-RUN]]; not yet
  reviewed by human experts.
title: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of a candidate proof of the Erdős–Gallai cycle
  decomposition conjecture (Erdős Problem #184)
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Coffey"
    given-names: "Ryan"
    affiliation: "Yale University"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "[YYYY-MM-DD]"
