repository-code: "https://github.com/steelwheel01/erdos-gallai-lean"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - graph decomposition
  - Erdős–Gallai conjecture
  - Erdős Problem 184
abstract: >-
  A candidate Lean 4 (v4.33.1, Mathlib v4.33.1) proof of the formal-conjectures statement
  Erdos184.erdos_184 (google-deepmind/formal-conjectures, commit 2424bb48), a formalization of
  the Erdős–Gallai conjecture that every n-vertex graph decomposes into O(n) cycles and edges.
  The proof formalizes a candidate manuscript. Both the manuscript and the formalization were
  written and reviewed by AI systems (Anthropic Claude models via Claude Code). Axioms: propext,
  Classical.choice, Quot.sound. Status: passes the project's acceptance checks
  [[PUBLIC-RELEASE-RUN]]; not yet reviewed by human experts; see README.md for the trust model
  and the verification record.
